{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"papers\": [\n    {\n      \"publication\": {\n        \"ref\": \"PMID:40864092\",\n        \"title\": \"Effect of Botulinum Toxin on Sensori-Motor Integration in Movement Disorders: A Scoping Review.\",\n        \"publication_status\": \"review\",\n        \"version_of_candidate\": null,\n        \"study_id_candidate\": \"unknown\",\n        \"cohort_id_candidate\": \"unknown\",\n        \"cohort_relation_basis\": \"综述摘要未提供纳入的FOG原始研究PMID/DOI、患者中心、招募时间或队列特征，无法识别原始研究及潜在队列重叠。\",\n        \"source_type\": \"secondary\",\n        \"basis\": \"abstract\",\n        \"fulltext_checked\": false\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"eid_local\": \"40864092-E1\",\n          \"design\": \"Scoping review；摘要报告PubMed检索、摘要筛选及相关论文全文审阅。\",\n          \"population\": \"帕金森病伴冻结步态患者；具体原始研究人群及样本特征未在摘要中提供。\",\n          \"n_enrolled\": null,\n          \"n_analyzed\": null,\n          \"n_patients_with_FOG\": null,\n          \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n          \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n          \"n_trials\": null,\n          \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n          \"missing_reason\": \"摘要未提及纳入FOG原始研究的患者数、事件数及神经记录数量；综述纳入论文数不能替代患者数。\",\n          \"endpoint_class\": \"unclear\",\n          \"event_phase\": \"unclear\",\n          \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported\",\n          \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n          \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n          \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"摘要未报告STN-DBS患者、刺激状态或参数。\",\n          \"task\": \"摘要未报告FOG原始研究的具体任务。\",\n          \"recording_location\": \"综述提及alternative striatal systems、cerebellum及其连接；未报告STN特异性神经记录。\",\n          \"measure\": \"慢性Botulinum toxin注射后感觉运动整合及中枢运动模式的综述性描述；不是STN-LFP或单单位神经活动测量。\",\n          \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"不适用；摘要未报告神经振荡频段或分析窗口。\",\n          \"finding\": \"综述认为，在FOG领域，慢性BoNT注射可能改变中枢运动模式，并涉及替代性纹状体系统、小脑及其连接。该结论是综述性解释，不是STN活动与FOG事件之间的直接证据。\",\n          \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告定量效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n          \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"综述层面定性综合；摘要未报告FOG相关原始研究的统计单位和统计方法。\",\n          \"risk_of_bias\": {\n            \"tool_or_framework\": \"AMSTAR 2/ROBIS相关域的摘要级初评；未见正式评分。\",\n            \"domains\": [\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"检索范围\",\n                \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n                \"reason\": \"摘要仅明确报告PubMed检索，其他数据库及灰色文献检索情况未说明。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Methods\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"研究选择\",\n                \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n                \"reason\": \"摘要称审阅所有检索结果的摘要，但未说明独立筛选人数及分歧处理。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Methods\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"原始研究偏倚评价\",\n                \"judgement\": \"not_assessable\",\n                \"reason\": \"摘要未报告对纳入原始研究进行正式偏倚风险评价。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Methods\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"证据综合\",\n                \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n                \"reason\": \"摘要未提供FOG相关原始研究的逐项证据及定量综合方法。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Results\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n                \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n                \"reason\": \"无法根据摘要判断研究方案与最终报告之间是否存在选择性报告。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Results\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n          },\n          \"limitations\": \"这是secondary evidence，不能作为新的独立患者队列或STN-FOG重复验证。摘要没有列出支持FOG结论的原始研究PMID/DOI。未提供自然步行实际冻结事件、事件阶段或STN神经记录。不能据此推断STN振荡改变。\",\n          \"quote\": \"In FOG, chronic BoNT injections may alter central motor patterns with inclusion of alternative striatal systems, cerebellum, and its connections.\",\n          \"source_locator\": {\n            \"section\": \"Abstract—Results\",\n            \"page\": null,\n            \"figure_table\": null,\n            \"supplement\": null\n          },\n          \"basis\": \"abstract\"\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"publication\": {\n        \"ref\": \"PMID:40871914\",\n        \"title\": \"Uncovering the Kinematic Signature of Freezing of Gait in Parkinson's Disease Through Wearable Inertial Sensors.\",\n        \"publication_status\": \"published\",\n        \"version_of_candidate\": null,\n        \"study_id_candidate\": \"unknown\",\n        \"cohort_id_candidate\": \"unknown\",\n        \"cohort_relation_basis\": \"摘要报告30名PD患者及20名健康对照，但未提供可用于与其他论文匹配的研究中心、招募时间或作者声明。\",\n        \"source_type\": \"primary\",\n        \"basis\": \"abstract\",\n        \"fulltext_checked\": false\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\n          \"eid_local\": \"40871914-E1\",\n          \"design\": \"观察性横断面步态测量研究。\",\n          \"population\": \"30名PD患者，其中15名FOG患者、15名无FOG患者；另有20名健康对照。\",\n          \"n_enrolled\": 50,\n          \"n_analyzed\": null,\n          \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 15,\n          \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n          \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n          \"n_trials\": null,\n          \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n          \"missing_reason\": \"摘要报告入组人数和FOG患者人数，但未报告实际分析人数、冻结事件数和试次数；本研究使用足部IMU而非神经记录，神经数据及电极数不适用。\",\n          \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n          \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n          \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported\",\n          \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n          \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n          \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"摘要未报告DBS植入情况、刺激状态或参数。\",\n          \"task\": \"步态测量；具体直行、转弯、启动及双任务条件未在摘要中说明。\",\n          \"recording_location\": \"双足佩戴的两个惯性测量单元（foot-mounted IMUs）；未记录STN神经活动。\",\n          \"measure\": \"步态周期阶段分布中的swing phase duration。\",\n          \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"IMU采样频率、滤波设置及分析窗口未在摘要中报告。\",\n          \"finding\": \"摘要报告PD患者的摆动相持续时间缩短，并指出整体运动能力下降在FOG患者中更明显；但没有提供FOG组与无FOG组之间该指标的独立定量比较。\",\n          \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告组间差值、标准化效应量、置信区间或P值。\",\n          \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者步态参数；具体统计模型、重复测量处理和多重比较校正未报告。\",\n          \"risk_of_bias\": {\n            \"tool_or_framework\": \"adapted_not_validated；观察性可穿戴传感器研究。\",\n            \"domains\": [\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"样本选择\",\n                \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n                \"reason\": \"样本量较小，摘要未说明连续入组、招募流程及排除标准。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Methods\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"行为标签有效性\",\n                \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n                \"reason\": \"未报告FOG诊断标准、临床确认方式或视频评审方法。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Methods\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"信号质量与伪迹\",\n                \"judgement\": \"some_concerns\",\n                \"reason\": \"摘要明确指出IMU测量minimum foot clearance存在较高测量误差，但未给出其他参数的完整信号质量指标。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Results\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"混杂\",\n                \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n                \"reason\": \"药物状态、疾病严重程度及其他潜在混杂因素的调整情况未报告。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Methods\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"重复测量与伪重复\",\n                \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n                \"reason\": \"未报告步态周期数量及周期嵌套于患者的统计处理方法。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Methods\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"多重比较\",\n                \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n                \"reason\": \"涉及多个步态指标，但摘要未报告多重比较校正。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Results\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"模型过拟合与外部验证\",\n                \"judgement\": \"not_applicable\",\n                \"reason\": \"摘要未报告机器学习预测模型。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Methods\"\n              },\n              {\n                \"domain\": \"选择性报告\",\n                \"judgement\": \"unclear\",\n                \"reason\": \"未提供预注册分析计划及全部预设结局。\",\n                \"source_locator\": \"Abstract—Results\"\n              }\n            ],\n            \"overall\": \"some_concerns\"\n          },\n          \"limitations\": \"这是FOG易感性分组的步态运动学证据，不是事件级FOG神经电生理证据。未测量STN活动，不能据此推断STN振荡与冻结事件的关系。\",\n          \"quote\": \"diminished swing phase duration observed in patients\",\n          \"source_locator\": {\n            \"section\": \"Abstract—Results\",\n            \"page\": null,\n            \"figure_table\": null,\n            \"supplement\": null\n          },\n          \"basis\": \"abstract\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"eid_local\": \"40871914-E2\",\n          \"design\": \"观察性横断面步态测量研究。\",\n          \"population\": \"30名PD患者，其中15名FOG患者、15名无FOG患者；另有20名健康对照。\",\n          \"n_enrolled\": 50,\n          \"n_analyzed\": null,\n          \"n_patients_with_FOG\": 15,\n          \"n_patients_with_valid_neural_data\": null,\n          \"n_FOG_events\": null,\n          \"n_trials\": null,\n          \"n_electrodes_contacts\": null,\n          \"missing_reason\": \"摘要未报告实际分析人数、冻结事件数和试次数；足部IMU属于运动学测量，不属于STN神经记录。\",\n          \"endpoint_class\": \"D_susceptibility\",\n          \"event_phase\": \"susceptibility\",\n          \"freezing_phenotype\": \"not_reported\",\n          \"medication_phenotype\": \"unknown\",\n          \"experimental_medication_state\": \"unknown\",\n          \"DBS_state_and_parameters\": \"未报告。\",\n          \"task\": \"步态测量；具体任务条件未报告。\",\n          \"recording_location\": \"双足IMU；未记录STN。\",\n          \"measure\": \"stride length。\",\n          \"frequency_and_analysis_window\": \"IMU采样频率、分析窗口及归一化方法未报告。\",\n          \"finding\": \"摘要报告PD患者的空间步态参数下降，其中包括stride length；整体运动能力下降在FOG患者中更加明显，但未报告FOG与非FOG患者之间该指标的独立效应量。\",\n          \"effect_estimate\": \"未报告stride length组间差值、置信区间或P值。\",\n          \"statistical_unit_and_method\": \"患者步态参数；统计模型未报告。\",\n      